  "solution": "Open pipe: $f_o = \\dfrac{v}{2L}$. Closed pipe: $f_c = \\dfrac{v}{4L}$.\n\n$$\\frac{f_o}{f_c} = \\frac{4L}{2L} = 2 : 1$$",
